title: "Company-as-Code"
message: "If you reference this framework in academic or professional work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Neves
    given-names: Gerald
repository-code: "https://github.com/gez-scrumsdotcom/Company-as-Code"
abstract: >
  An open-source operating system for AI-native organizations. Company-as-Code
  externalizes organizational state, workflows, agents, obligations, and
  capabilities into a version-controlled repository with typed schemas,
  deterministic generators, referential-integrity enforcement, and a
  compliance coverage gate that fails the build rather than the audit.
keywords:
  - company-as-code
  - organizational-design
  - gitops
  - ai-agents
  - compliance-as-code
  - infrastructure-as-code
  - multi-agent-systems
license: Apache-2.0
